  "bodyHash": "JaBM+NlQ7A8=",
  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1157/728/elemental_wizards_banner-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2500\" height=\"1565\">🧙‍♂️🌊⛰️🌪️掌控元素之力，擊敗你的敵人！</h1><h4><strong>Wizards (RPG系列) 擴展模組 - 新增3種元素巫師子職業（大地、流水與狂風）</strong></h4><hr><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/loader-fabric-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"146\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252felemental-wizards-rpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/modrinth-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a> &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fAShKd5XrTu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"28\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252ffichteee\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/donations-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=kofi&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"28\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/ProfessorFichte/Elemental-Wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-black?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=grey\" alt=\"\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a></p><hr><h2>📂 安裝說明</h2><h4><strong>🚨必備模組</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spell-engine\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spell Engine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-rpg-classes\" rel=\"nofollow\">More RPG Library</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/azurelib-armor\" rel=\"nofollow\">Azure Lib Armor</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizards\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wizards (RPG系列)</a></li>\n</ul><h4><strong>👍強烈推薦模組</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Combat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/daedelus_dev/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">完整RPG系列專案</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-rpg-jewelry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Additional RPG Jewelry</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-n-explore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Loot &amp; </a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/loot-n-explore\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explore </a>&amp; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lne-wizards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">LNE Wizards</a></li>\n</ul><hr><h2>🕹️ 特色功能</h2><h3>✨法術系統</h3><ul>\n<li>運用不同元素的巫師法術，讓戰鬥更加有趣</li>\n<li>流水巫師是半輔助治療型，同時也能造成可觀傷害！</li>\n<li>大地巫師是坦克型控場職業，擅長持續傷害且生存力強</li>\n<li>狂風巫師專精擊退與浮空連招，是控場大師</li>\n<li>裝備綁定法術池的咒術書或特殊武器即可施法</li>\n<li>製作咒術書需要法術綁定台（或在合成表中搜索）<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/578/spell_binding_e_wizards-png.png\" alt=\"法術池\" width=\"800\" height=\"300\"></li>\n</ul><hr><p>🤺戰鬥與裝備</p><ul>\n<li>打造專屬風、土、水元素的法杖與魔杖！</li>\n<li>合成元素符文，這是施法的必備材料</li>\n<li>建議搭配Better Combat模組獲得最佳體驗</li>\n<li>武器、護甲與法術會受元素法術強度影響<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1097/591/elemental_wizards-png.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"300\"></li>\n</ul><hr><h4>🤝<strong>兼容模組列表</strong></h4><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterEnd</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" rel=\"nofollow\">BetterNether</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rune Essence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/zephyr\" rel=\"nofollow\">Zephyr</a> 感謝MuonR的兼容支援！</li>\n</ul><h3>⚙️配置設定</h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><strong>護甲與武器加成：</strong></li>\n<li>_config/elemental_wizards_rpg/items.json</li>\n<li><strong>狀態效果數值：</strong></li>\n<li>_config/elemental_wizards_rpg/effects.json</li>\n<li><strong>戰利品注入：</strong></li>\n<li>_config/rpg_series/loot.json</li>\n</ul>\n</div><hr><h3>🎥 實機展示</h3><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>感謝所有創作者的模組展示影片😊！</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/NXNDYmtoJIM?t=3s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hi9ZpCR7UKo?t=423s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nfJhQBMwtWg?si=jrxx0REFXGeM52w9\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n</div><hr><h1><strong>🙌製作團隊</strong></h1><ul>\n<li>感謝Deadelus開發強大的Spell Engine API</li>\n<li>感謝Damienbrittan設計絕佳的模組橫幅！</li>\n</ul><p>歡迎加入Discord伺服器交流模組心得與建議！</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/AShKd5XrTu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1209063880790376468?style=plastic&amp;logo=discord&amp;label=Discord&amp;labelColor=black&amp;color=blue&amp;link=https://discord.gg/AShKd5XrTu\" alt=\"\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\"></a></p>",
